      {
        "index": 1,
        "text": "For a class project, Ben compared two fictional shopping centres. A chart showed that visits to Centre A rose from forty thousand to fifty thousand in one year. This was an increase of twenty-five per cent. Ben first wrote that visits had risen to twenty-five per cent, but his teacher asked him to check the units.",
