      {
        "index": 3,
        "text": "The proportion of visitors arriving by bicycle also changed. At Centre A, it rose from ten per cent to fifteen per cent, a rise of five percentage points. In relative terms, that was a fifty per cent increase. The two statements described the same change from different perspectives.",
        "zh": "骑自行车到访的访客比例也变了。A中心的这一比例从百分之十升至百分之十五，即增加五个百分点。相对增幅则是百分之五十。这两种说法从不同角度描述了同一个变化。",
